    "body": "`PROCESS_VERSION 9` · PR #753 · build pipeline unified on xtask:\n- **Zip:** `cargo xtask package` is the one place the Windows portable zip is laid out. Both `release.yml` and `cargo xtask release` call it, so the inline PowerShell block in the workflow is gone.\n- **CI:** `ci.yml` and `nightly.yml` call `cargo xtask gate batch|release` directly, and are still manual-only.\n- **Docs:** `scripts/README.md` is rewritten around `cargo xtask`.\n- **Process files:** the list now also includes `scripts/release.ps1` and `scripts/collect-decisions.ps1`/`.sh`.\n\n**Forks:** sync process files with the full list in AGENTS.md: `git checkout upstream/main -- AGENTS.md .claude/agents .claude/skills .claude/PROCESS_VERSION xtask .cargo/config.toml scripts/gate.ps1 scripts/gate.sh scripts/release.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.sh`. The `release.yml` change ships with the next cut tag.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
