    "body": "`PROCESS_VERSION 12` · PR #846 · new project skill `classify-effort` (`.claude/skills/classify-effort/`): one way to choose an issue's `effort:*` label - `/classify-effort <N>` for one issue, `/classify-effort` for every open issue without one, `/classify-effort audit` to list labels that look wrong (read-only). AGENTS.md \"Set at filing\" points at it; the skill only sets a missing label and never lowers one. · A fork: pull the process files (the command in this issue's body); no product code changes.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
